I heard that you love to see Ebitu perform live.

228
00:17:32,996 --> 00:17:33,006
I heard that you love EBITCHU's performance.

229
00:17:33,006 --> 00:17:37,626
I heard that there are members of the group who can't help but look at him as a professional idol as well, and they rave that they can watch him for the rest of their lives

230
00:17:37,626 --> 00:17:59,926
He said he could watch them for the rest of his life.

231
00:17:59,926 --> 00:18:01,946
Here is the performance

232
00:18:03,006 --> 00:18:21,586
She said she loves Ebitu's performance.

233
00:18:21,592 --> 00:18:25,592
I really like your style, Cocona.

234
00:18:25,592 --> 00:18:27,592
I think she has a great style.

235
00:18:27,592 --> 00:18:29,592
The angles of her body

236
00:18:29,592 --> 00:18:33,592
I can't help but admire her style and the angles of her body.

237
00:18:34,592 --> 00:18:37,592
Cocona received a shout out from Miki Ito.

238
00:18:37,592 --> 00:18:40,592
Ebitu Sakuragi Cocona?

239
00:18:41,592 --> 00:18:42,592
Is it over?

240
00:18:42,592 --> 00:18:43,592
It's over!

241
00:18:43,592 --> 00:18:46,592
I'm so happy, I feel so good!

242
00:18:47,630 --> 00:18:52,970
I'm so happy that I'd be happy even if we had another 15 minutes or so.

243
00:18:52,970 --> 00:18:54,970
Just a little bit more.

244
00:18:54,970 --> 00:19:02,230
I've been dancing since I was 6 years old, and it's my favorite genre.

245
00:19:02,230 --> 00:19:07,090
I've been dancing since I was 6 years old, and I love it.

246
00:19:07,090 --> 00:19:10,130
I was so happy to hear you say you like it.

247
00:19:10,130 --> 00:19:14,890
Here, Cocona Sakuragi gives an idol shout-out to Miki Ito.

248
00:19:15,502 --> 00:19:26,942
In my opinion, SKE is really cute and pure and beautiful, like dancing angels.

249
00:19:26,942 --> 00:19:29,742
There are many SKE members, aren't there?

250
00:19:29,742 --> 00:19:33,622
That's the image I had of SKE.

251
00:19:33,622 --> 00:19:41,302
But the songs "Absolute Inspiration" and "Confessions of a Heartbeat" have such a strong dance performance.

252
00:19:41,302 --> 00:19:43,002
It's like...

253
00:19:43,006 --> 00:19:52,726
What do you call it? Of course I can dance, but I felt like I was in a really beautiful world, so I wondered if I could do it too.

254
00:19:52,726 --> 00:19:59,906
There were so many of them, and yet each one of them danced so well.

255
00:19:59,906 --> 00:20:09,466
Seeing how well SKE's dancers danced together, I thought, "Oh my God, we really need to have all 9 dancers dancing together.

256
00:20:09,466 --> 00:20:12,406
I was reminded of that again.

257
00:20:12,430 --> 00:20:20,670
Miki Ito is such a pretty, calm, chatty and talkative person.

258
00:20:20,670 --> 00:20:28,990
I was surprised at the gap between her being such a cute, calm, chatty talker and being an athletic person.

259
00:20:28,990 --> 00:20:31,610
I was betrayed in a good way.

260
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:38,630
Thank you Manaka Mana, Ruru Danbara, and Miki Ito for your yells full of love!
